  "details": "The \"Avatar Dynamic Permissions\" Help & Info article hasn't been updated in a while and is now almost entirely inaccurate.\n\n1. Open Main Menu.\n\n2. Click the \"?\" icon top right for Help & Info.\n\n3. Navigate to Safety group on the left.\n\n4. Click \"Avatar Dynamic Permissions\" and scroll down to find outdated photos and text.\n\n5. Compare to the current design of the Launch Pad in Quick Menu and avatar interactions UI. The icons have changed, the menu has been redesigned, layouts may be different.",
